{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil crystal shattered gravity, lifting the world into floating ruins. Climb the sky islands, destroy the crystal core, and restore gravity before everything is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLING UP TOGETHER</strong> is a 3D co-op physics platformer for 2 to 4 players, where progress is impossible alone. You are bound together by a rope, and the only way upward is to grab, pull, and fling your friends across impossible gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one player falls, everyone resets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB THE SKY ISLANDS OR FALL FOREVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/aac63c55772b798e2306d09d5170202c.poster.avif?t=1772745132\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/aac63c55772b798e2306d09d5170202c.webm?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/aac63c55772b798e2306d09d5170202c.mp4?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single massive vertical world, no loading screens. Checkpoints only activate when the whole team arrives. One mistake sends everyone back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLING YOUR FRIENDS TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/2a41ecead79db8a8d656d2f660dc2773.poster.avif?t=1772745132\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/2a41ecead79db8a8d656d2f660dc2773.webm?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/2a41ecead79db8a8d656d2f660dc2773.mp4?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can pull the rope at any time. Use momentum and tension to launch teammates to distant platforms or rescue them from falling. A bad pull can doom the entire run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLOR-LOCKED PATHS FORCE COORDINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/211dcf1ba1ec83ffcff3ae28ed1ef551.poster.avif?t=1772745132\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/211dcf1ba1ec83ffcff3ae28ed1ef551.webm?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/211dcf1ba1ec83ffcff3ae28ed1ef551.mp4?t=1772745132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is a color and can only activate matching platforms, switches, and gates. One player opens the route, then must help the others cross. No solo progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top, destroy the crystal core, and restore gravity. Do it together, or keep falling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986580?t=1772745132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/ebc605aa22ccd2911c59998a3c49455a303ffecc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772745132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/f91fde7d89e52c37c68590b3c0d255b70a69dd53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772745132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/398